          "file": "patches/freetype/001-disable-gzip.patch",
          "sha256": "0da84ce69eb6d86c81bafe20ee994a6ee955d88679d1a23954ba0b2999a2a90d",
          "reason": "freetype 2.12.1 built without system zlib embeds its bundled zlib with public symbol names (ftgzip.obj defines inflate/inflateUndermine/crc32_z/zcalloc and the rest of the zlib surface - the 2.12.x unmodified-zlib import regression), which collides at engine link time with the zlib statically embedded in FreeImageLib.lib (30 x LNK2005 in section 80); the engine never loads gzip-compressed fonts, and commenting out FT_CONFIG_OPTION_USE_ZLIB makes src/gzip/ftgzip.c compile its no-zlib stub (FT_Stream_OpenGzip -> Unimplemented_Feature), removing every duplicate symbol (DEC-089)"
        }
      ],
